  "pdf_cells": [
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          568.1252684873949,
          69.01270219714968,
          266.6226210084035,
          13.3226018408551
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/GillSans-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "OPERATIONS REVIEW"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          170.5350688836104,
          680.2497549159665,
          11.820842933491804
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Australia, and particularly the north west is impoverished in terms of infrastructure to service"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          191.47361549881248,
          680.2145776050421,
          11.820842933491576
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "our marine industries. Some of this has been due to a historical link with our recent industrial"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          212.41217428741095,
          680.2199007142857,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "past. This is now behind us, and Australia has now become a centre of excellence with respect"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          233.35073307600953,
          601.4277889495798,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "to both new building and ship repair, particularly for high tech and specialty vessels."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          275.2265724465559,
          680.2145776050421,
          11.820842933491576
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The Mermaid slipway will be the third such facility on the western half of the continent , with"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          296.1651312351544,
          289.0517692016807,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "others located at Fremantle and Darwin."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          338.04223663895493,
          680.2093750840337,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The slipway will be a repair only facility, no new building is contemplated. Its capacity is"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          358.9807954275535,
          680.235715,
          11.820842933491576
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "structured to meet the regional steel mono-hulled fleet requirements of some 60 vessels between"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          379.9193420427554,
          680.2058091176472,
          11.820842933491804
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "200 and 4000 tonne displacement. Fishing industry, marine tourist industry, large private"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          400.85790083135396,
          592.0763435714285,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "pleasure craft , naval, scientific and law enforcement vessels are a secondary target."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          442.7350062351544,
          680.211115,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The slipway is designed to initially accept vessels up to 2,700 tonnes, a restriction which is set"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          463.673565023753,
          680.2163175210085,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "by our current inventory of cradles used to support vessel on the slip. The cradles will be"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          484.61212381235157,
          680.1935607983194,
          11.820830760094964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "progressively upgraded to ultimately handle 4000 tonne. A later expansion will allow 500 tonne"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          505.5506704275534,
          380.7851175210084,
          11.820842933491747
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "vessels to be side slipped, thereby increasing capacity."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          547.427775831354,
          680.2181607983193,
          11.820842933491747
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The slipway location and orientation on the Base has been chosen to maximize the cost and load"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          568.3663346199526,
          676.9639322268907,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "bearing benefits of having a very high strength granite bedrock as the best possible foundation."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          610.2422226840855,
          680.0371578571428,
          11.820830760095077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The Mermaid slipway will rank second in terms of capacity on the western half of the continent."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          631.1807692992875,
          680.0054948319328,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Tenix, Fremantle 8,000 tonne, Mermaid Dampier 2,700 tonne rising to 4,000 tonne, Darwin Ship"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          652.119328087886,
          678.5084091176471,
          11.820842933491747
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Repair 2,500 tonne. The nearest other facilities are Singapore, Adelaide, Port Moresby or Cairns."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          328.6708668067227,
          693.9952039786224,
          500.23572857142864,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Mermaid has purchased a very large cyclone rated industrial building"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          328.6708668067227,
          714.933762767221,
          500.24098277310935,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "frame which will be sited beside the slipway and tenanted by Mermaid"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          328.6708668067227,
          735.8723215558196,
          500.2480285714286,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "engineering and companies which will provide ancillary services"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          328.6708668067227,
          756.8108681710214,
          151.5711428571429,
          11.820867280285029
